<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amati started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amati started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said analyst Kevin Slocum started coverage of Amati Communications Corp with short-term buy and long-term hold.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 1/2 to 21.</p>
